  "deletedAt": null,
  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "Not everyone wants to potentially forget a subscription (that is actually quite expensive in some countries due to lack of international pricing) if you insist it is too expensive to be a free service. \n\nIt is bad enough that verification is restricted on what countries are supported by Persona. Now it is also paywalled through a system that doesn't account for international currency transfer rates. (For one person I know it is nearly $28 usd after fees/taxes to get one month of VRC+ just to verify)\n\nMuch of this could be solved by at least adding a one time payment for verification that only takes into account the portion of one's VRC+ sub that would cover the age verification fee to avoid communities being separated?\n\nOr maybe just.. not charge so much for the one feature you have finally implemented keeping children out of mature spaces.",
